    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eiwuang'ie Yosia eseremare oo ntokitin neme Enkai",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki olaiguanani airriwaa olkilikuai, nepuonu ilpayiani pooki le Yuda o Yerusalem aaiturrurrokino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neilep olaiguanani alo enkaji o Laitoriani, netii iltung'ana pooki le Yuda o lelo pooki oomanya Yerusalem, o lapolosak o loibonok le Nkai, o ltung'ana pooki, ilooti o lkituaak; neisum ninye ening'ito ninche irorei pooki leina buku o sotua apa nanotoki tiatua enkaji o Laitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitashe olaiguanani te mbata oo ng'apeta neitobir olning'o te dukuya Olaitoriani, pee esuj orrekie lo Laitoriani neibung nkitanapat enyena, o enchakenisho enye o nkikoot enyena, to ltau lenye pooki, o te nkishui enye pooki, pee eas irorei leilo ning'o lo sotua ooigero tena buku; neibung'are ltung'ana pooki tenebo ninye teilo ning'o lo sotua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
