            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.21.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ilai 21.3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.33.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Int 33.3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neitanap olaiguanani Hilkia ilo apolosani kitok, o lapolosak oosujaki te nkitoo, o laing'urak le kishomi, pee eipang'unyeki tiatua enkaji o Laitoriani nena masaa pooki apa naaitobirakaki Baal, o Ashera, o lorora pooki le keper. Nepejoo ninye ninche tiauluo Yerusalem too nkong'at e Kedron, nenap nkuruon enye aaya Betel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neiwuang'ie ninye lelo apolosak apa ootuputo ilaiguanak le Yuda pee epej enkorropil too wuejitin neeika too nkanas e Yuda naamanita Yerusalem; o kulie sii oopejoki Baal enkorropil, aapejoki enkolong o lapa, o lakir, o lorora pooki le keper. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neipang'unye ninye ashera aitung'uaa enkaji o Laitoriani, neya auluo Yerusalem, neya oerata le Kedron, nelo apejoo to erata le Kedron, neidong aitaa empunyua neisuaki ina punyua nkuraren oo ltung'ana le setia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Negil ninye nkajijik oo lewa le nkisiaayiare e seremare e nkiborra oo nkonyek, apa naatii atua enkaji o Laitoriani. Ine apa eripunye nkituaak nkisiong'at e Ashera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyau lelo apolosak lenye pooki aitupuku too nkanas e Yuda, neisarkionie ninye wuejitin neeika apa naapejie ilapolosak enkorropil, ebaiki Geba o metabaiki Beer-sheba; neitoki ninye agil auroo nena wuejitin neeika oo nchomito apa naatii enejing'ieki kishomi e Yoshua ilo balusui le nkanasa, apa naatii enkalo e Kedienye teina kishomi e nkanasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake eyia, eitu epuonu lelo apolosak loo wuejitin neeika aapuonu olperere lo lasar lo Laitoriani te Yerusalem. Kake einosa ninche imukateni neitu eisuijieki tiatua ilalashera lenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.18.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilaw 18.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.7.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 7.31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.19.1+JER.19.2+JER.19.3+JER.19.4+JER.19.5+JER.19.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "19.1-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.32.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "32.35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neisarkionie ninye Tofet, ina natii oerata loo layiok le Hinom, pee meitoki atii hoo obo opejoo olayioni lenye anaa entito enye aitaa olasar oishori Molek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neiwuang'ie ninye nena bartan naaitisinya ilaiguanak le Yuda te nkaraki eseremata enkolong, te nejing'ieki enkaji o laitoriani, te mbata e nkaji e Natan-Melek, laa ninye olkitok. Etapejoyie apa ninye nena garrin oo mbartan naaseremieki enkolong te nkima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.21.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ilai 21.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.33.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Int 33.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore lelo pereren loo lasarri ootii enchumata enkaji e shumata e nkaji e Ahas, apa naaitobira ilaiguanak le Yuda, o lpereren apa ooitobira Manase too lgorieti pokira oare le nkaji o Laitoriani, nesulu ninche aitadou nebel aitaa mbelibelat, nenang'aki ina punyua enye atua oerata le Kedron. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.11.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Int 11.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neitoki olaiguanani aisarkionie iwuejitin neeika apa naatii enkalo oloo saen le Yerusalem, o metabaiki kopikop o ldoinyo le ntorroni, naateshetaka apa Solomon olaiguanani le Israeli Ashterot, ilo minong loo le Sidon, neitobiraki sii Kemosh ilo minong loo le Moab, o Milkoni ilo minong loo Lamoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Negil ninye aitaa mbelibelat nena ng'apeta, neuroo asulaki enkop Asherim, neiput iwuejitin enye iloik loo ltung'ana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
